WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.826 --> 00:00:02.834
SELINA KYLE:
Who are you under there?

00:00:06.766 --> 00:00:07.766
BRUCE WAYNE: I'm vengeance.

00:00:08.415 --> 00:00:09.391
♪ (INTENSE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:09.468 --> 00:00:10.633
We're gonna have
to work together.

00:00:12.287 --> 00:00:13.295
H-- H-- Hey!

00:00:14.179 --> 00:00:15.271
It's like a real team out there.

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:17.281
LARRY TRAINOR: Are you trying
to give us a rally speech?

00:00:19.743 --> 00:00:21.313
BRUCE:
When that light hits the sky,

00:00:21.719 --> 00:00:23.821
it's not just a call,
it's a warning.

00:00:24.882 --> 00:00:26.527
JONATHAN KENT: You were
sent here for a reason.

00:00:27.459 --> 00:00:29.488
WONDER WOMAN:
Nothing good is born from lies.

00:00:30.239 --> 00:00:31.823
Oh, hey, what's up?
I'm a superhero.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:34.499
ALMA ORTEGA:
I'm not giving up. Not yet.

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:35.827
-(LAUGHTER)
-Boo!

00:00:36.862 --> 00:00:37.902
-Eat peace!
-(EAGLY SHRIEKS)

00:00:38.211 --> 00:00:39.086
-Whoa!
-(ALL GROANING)

00:00:39.162 --> 00:00:40.763
We are not the kind of people
that kill people.

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:47.214
You come after family,
we show no mercy.

00:00:47.604 --> 00:00:50.092
I got you! (LAUGHS) I got you.

00:00:51.149 --> 00:00:55.837
♪ (MUSIC CLIMAXES) ♪

